{"id":"vod_md_3198","vodId":"3198","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"学园孤岛","name_cn":"学园孤岛","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/63043f765793e5b69ca4f5e5e1e15a10.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在巡之丘学园中，丈枪由纪（水濑祈 配音）天真可爱，是名副其实的开心果。惠飞须泽胡桃（小泽亚李 配音）踏实可靠，她的坚强和元气影响了身边的每一个人。若狭悠里（市道真央 配音）温柔坚强，是大家心目中稳重的靠山。直树美纪（高桥李依 配音）外表冷漠，但内心的热情不容忽视。这些可爱的孩子们共同组成了“学园生活部”，每天都在进行愉快的部活。空无一人的校园，破败不堪的教室，四处游走的行尸，究竟哪一个是幻想，哪一个是真实？巨大的灾难面前，少女们将恐惧化作力量，尽各自的所能，目的只有一个，那就是活得更久，更快乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-24 08:15:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/KROpsqt2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/qUgLd9iP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/pxSh8ClG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/SNZKFIEK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/r68gWBHN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/MB10KvwU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/fLcyuAlg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/6lAMmEcy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/pZrhDLAp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/yRDMtqsY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/YbzMH4WG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/s4lnTDNX/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:12.135Z"}